WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.752
Where does your text go when you translate it?

2
00:00:06.228 --> 00:00:09.343
In Passage, it stays on your computer.

3
00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:13.134
A small local model translates as you type.

4
00:00:13.384 --> 00:00:16.797
The status line names the model that answered.

5
00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:22.850
Type the same sentence again, and the answer is instant.

6
00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:27.082
Engines shows where every word went.

7
00:00:27.332 --> 00:00:30.468
One hundred percent of it stayed on this machine.

8
00:00:30.718 --> 00:00:35.155
The repeat came from this session's cache, so nothing was sent at all.

9
00:00:35.655 --> 00:00:39.410
It also waits for whole words before asking the model.

10
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:44.588
Over five typed sentences, that cut requests from fourteen to eight.

11
00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:48.823
Passage. Private by default, and it shows its work.
